    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"GridFsTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>GridFsTemplate</code></a> using the given <a href=\"../MongoDatabaseFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>MongoDatabaseFactory</code></a> and <a href=\"../core/convert/MongoConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert\"><code>MongoConverter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用给定的<a href=\"../MongoDatabaseFactory.html\" title=\"接口在 org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>MongoDatabaseFactory</code></a>和<a href=\"../core/convert/MongoConverter.html\" title=\"接口在 org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert\"><code>MongoConverter</code></a>创建一个新的<a href=\"GridFsTemplate.html\" title=\"类在 org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>GridFsTemplate</code></a>。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>converter</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>converter</code> 不能为 null。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>query</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>query</code> 不能为空。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Note that the <code>GridFSBucket</code> is obtained only once from <a href=\"../MongoDatabaseFactory.html#getMongoDatabase()\"><code>MongoDatabase</code></a>. Use <a href=\"#%3Cinit%3E(org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert.MongoConverter,java.util.function.Supplier)\"><code>GridFsTemplate(MongoConverter, Supplier)</code></a> if you want to use different buckets from the\nsame Template instance.",
      "translation": "请注意，<code>GridFSBucket</code> 仅从 <a href=\"../MongoDatabaseFactory.html#getMongoDatabase()\"><code>MongoDatabase</code></a> 获取一次。如果您希望使用相同的模板实例访问不同的存储桶，请使用 <a href=\"#%3Cinit%3E(org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert.MongoConverter,java.util.function.Supplier)\"><code>GridFsTemplate(MongoConverter, Supplier)</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"GridFsTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>GridFsTemplate</code></a> using the given <a href=\"../core/convert/MongoConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert\"><code>MongoConverter</code></a> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Supplier.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Supplier</code></a> providing the\nrequired <code>GridFSBucket</code>.",
      "translation": "使用给定的<a href=\"../core/convert/MongoConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert\"><code>MongoConverter</code></a>和提供所需<code>GridFSBucket</code>的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Supplier.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Supplier</code></a>创建一个新的<a href=\"GridFsTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>GridFsTemplate</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"GridFsResource.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>GridFsResource</code></a> for a <code>GridFSFile</code>.",
