    {
      "source": "Stores the given <a href=\"GridFsObject.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>GridFsObject</code></a>, likely a <a href=\"GridFsUpload.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>GridFsUpload</code></a>, into into a file with given\n<a href=\"GridFsObject.html#getFilename()\"><code>name</code></a>. If the <a href=\"GridFsObject.html#getFileId()\"><code>GridFsObject.getFileId()</code></a> is set, the file will be stored\nwith that id, otherwise the server auto creates a new id. <br/>",
      "translation": "将给定的<a href=\"GridFsObject.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>GridFsObject</code></a>（可能为<a href=\"GridFsUpload.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>GridFsUpload</code></a>）存储到具有指定<a href=\"GridFsObject.html#getFilename()\"><code>name</code></a>的文件中。如果已设置<a href=\"GridFsObject.html#getFileId()\"><code>GridFsObject.getFileId()</code></a>，则文件将使用该 id 进行存储；否则，服务器会自动创建一个新的 id。<br/>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Stores the given <a href=\"GridFsObject.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>GridFsObject</code></a>, likely a <a href=\"GridFsUpload.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>GridFsUpload</code></a>, into into a file with given\n<a href=\"GridFsObject.html#getFilename()\"><code>name</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将给定的 <a href=\"GridFsObject.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>GridFsObject</code></a>（可能是 <a href=\"GridFsUpload.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>GridFsUpload</code></a>）存储到具有给定<a href=\"GridFsObject.html#getFilename()\"><code>name</code></a>的文件中。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns all files matching the given query. Note, that currently <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> criterias defined at the\n<a href=\"../core/query/Query.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a> will not be regarded as MongoDB does not support ordering for GridFS file access.",
      "translation": "返回所有匹配给定查询的文件。请注意，目前 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> 中定义的、在 <a href=\"../core/query/Query.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a> 中的排序条件不会被考虑，因为 MongoDB 不支持对 GridFS 文件访问进行排序。",
      "count": 1
    },
